# The blanket test_*/run_* patterns above would otherwise hide the committed
# pytest suite under tests/. Keep that directory tracked...
!tests/
!tests/**
# ...but still ignore compiled bytecode the suite generates (the negation above
# would otherwise re-include it).
tests/**/__pycache__/
tests/**/*.pyc